# projects/ is UNTRACKED by choice (2026-08-04). Algo work in progress stays local and
# does not get pushed. Consequence to be aware of: PROJECT.md files then have no version
# history and no off-machine copy, so back them up some other way.
# _TEMPLATE stays tracked - it is repo scaffolding that CLAUDE.md tells you to copy from.
projects/*
!projects/_TEMPLATE/

.obsidian/
.DS_Store
*.log
node_modules/
.env
.env.local

# Working output from `patterns.py --extract`
*.pattern.json

__pycache__/
*.pyc
